Elves combo-aggro: flood the board with mana-elves (Heritage Druid, Nettle Sentinel, Fyndhorn/Llanowar Elves, Quirion Ranger), chain them into Glimpse of Nature to draw your deck, then finish with a huge Craterhoof Behemoth overrun or Green Sun's Zenith / Natural Order for it. Wirewood Symbiote + Visionary generate value. Gaea's Cradle makes explosive mana. Go wide, then go tall and swing.
